window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>It’s the honor of an Amplifier to bear an Alpha’s heir, to provide him a son worthy of his name and the land’s magic.</i></p> <p>This has been Addison’s expectation—among others—from birth, taught that it’s the noble thing for her to do without power of her own. So when an unexpected raid murders her mate and his entire pack, she flees to a remote town where she lives her days bereft and pregnant as the sole survivor.</p> <p>Until the impossible finds her two years later.</p> <p>Three Shifters from her pack—one her loyal Protector and all of whom should be dead—show up on her doorstep, claiming her son to be the new Alpha. To save him from his worsening illness, Addison must gather her wits and return with them to her old pack lands.</p> <p>Except, these men are nothing like the Shifters she remembers. And the longer she stays, the more lies from her past start coming to light. While she battles between her mind and her heart, danger follows in their tracks.</p> <p>But this time, Addison won’t stay hidden.</p>"; 
